This project focuses on image-to-prompt inversion using the Latent Consistency Model (LCM) Dreamshaper_v7 to accurately recreate six target images. An LLM-based refinement methodology was applied across 10 iterative testing rounds, optimizing text prompts based on spatial composition, artistic style, and lighting attributes. The generated images were rigorously evaluated using three complementary metrics: CLIP image-image similarity, LPIPS AlexNet distance, and Pixel RMSE. The final testing round successfully consolidated the best prompt strategies, demonstrating that highly detailed descriptions and iterative refinement with fidelity terms significantly improve both the semantic and perceptual accuracy of the generated images.
